        "ResultVariable": "",
        "SQL": "-- ImportDafJson makes an XSD string with no maxLength nvarchar(max), which SQL Server\r\n-- cannot use as an index key. DAF ids are 36-character UUIDs.\r\nIF COL_LENGTH(\u0027\u00A4{DafDbSchema,L}\u00A4.\u00A4{entityname,L}\u00A4\u0027, \u0027id_lokalid\u0027) = -1\r\n    ALTER TABLE \u00A4{DafDbSchema,L}\u00A4.\u00A4{entityname,L}\u00A4 ALTER COLUMN id_lokalid nvarchar(40) NOT NULL;",
        "MaxRows": "0",
